#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html:25
#, draft
msgid ""
"A plugin's own file is checked against the checksum its catalogue signed. Its requirements are not: those are fetched from PyPI when it is installed, and are whatever is served that day. Trusting a plugin means trusting its list of requirements too. Postulo installs only built wheels, never a source package that would run its own code while installing, and records everything that arrived."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl tal-plugin innifsu jiġi vverifikat kontra l-checksum iffirmat mill-katalgu tiegħu. Ir-rekwiżiti tiegħu le: dawk jinġiebu minn PyPI meta jiġi installat, u huma dak li jiġi servut dakinhar. Li tafda plugin ifisser li tafda wkoll il-lista tar-rekwiżiti tiegħu. Postulo jinstalla biss pakketti mibnija (wheels), qatt pakkett tas-sors li jħaddem il-kodiċi tiegħu waqt l-installazzjoni, u jżomm rekord ta’ dak kollu li wasal."

