msgstr "Iva"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/signin.html:33
#, draft
msgid "yes — a verified address matches"
msgstr "iva — indirizz ivverifikat jaqbel"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/signin.html:29
#, draft
msgid "yes — the identity provider is the invitation"
msgstr "iva — il-fornitur tal-identità huwa l-istedina"

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:42
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: anyone who finds the address may create an account. No: invitation only. An empty instance always offers the sign-up form, so somebody can become the first account."
msgstr ""
"Iva: kull min isib l-indirizz jista' joħloq kont. Le: bi stedina biss. Istanza vojta dejjem toffri l-formola tar-reġistrazzjoni, biex xi ħadd ikun jista' jsir l-ewwel kont."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:51
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: somebody who arrives through the identity provider is signed straight in, without being asked for a code as well. Say yes only if you know that provider checks identity at least as carefully as Postulo would. It never applies to a password sign-in, and it removes nobody's authenticator app. A passkey already counts on its own and needs no setting."
msgstr ""
"Iva: min jasal permezz tal-fornitur tal-identità jidħol direttament, mingħajr ma jintalab ukoll kodiċi. Wieġeb iva biss jekk taf li dak il-fornitur jivverifika l-identità mill-inqas bl-istess reqqa bħal Postulo. Qatt ma japplika għal dħul b’password u ma jneħħi l-app ta’ awtentikazzjoni ta’ ħadd. Passkey diġà tgħodd waħedha u ma teħtieġ l-ebda issettjar."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:62
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: somebody who has forgotten their password can ask for a code at their primary address and type it back. A code rather than a link, because mail scanners follow links and would spend one before the person read it. It is never a second factor: an authenticator app is still asked for. Offered only while this instance's mail is actually getting through."
msgstr ""
"Iva: min insa l-password jista' jitlob kodiċi fuq l-indirizz primarju tiegħu u jerġa' jiktbu. Kodiċi u mhux link, għax l-iskaners tal-posta jsegwu l-links u jonfquh qabel ma l-persuna taqrah. Qatt mhu tieni fattur: l-app ta' awtentikazzjoni xorta tintalab. Offrut biss sakemm il-posta ta' din l-istanza tabilħaqq tasal."

